## Hosted Account Flows
- When the user is asking about a definition already stored in their Cargo AI account, mention the direct interpreted run path:
  - `cargo ai account run <name>`
  - `cargo ai account agents run <name> --owner-handle <handle>`
- Keep `cargo ai account hatch <name>` as the frozen/export path for hosted definitions.

## Claude-Specific Guidance
- Use canonical `--config` commands; avoid shorthand invocation forms.
- Keep assumptions explicit in comments/notes while iterating on configs.
- Treat `.cargo-ai/examples/invalid/*` as validation fixtures, not production starting points.
